      "id": "claim_a3330c9bc4694ceca1a48bb49d6dad25",
      "statement": "OpenAIDecisions is a RunnableSerializable that answers typed questions via OpenAI's Decisions API; supports Predicate (boolean probability), Choice (multi-option selection with probabilities), and Score (numeric rating with confidence); responses include model name, answers dict keyed by question name, usage metadata, and request_id; invoke()/ainvoke() call _decide()/_adecide() which construct payload and POST to /decisions endpoint; configuration mirrors ChatOpenAI (api_key, base_url, organization, timeout, max_retries, http_client, http_async_client).",
