      "id": "claim_b9d2147be17b49a99a3af46aff4ff1f2",
      "statement": "Model validator validate_temperature() enforces model-specific constraints: o1 models default to temperature=1 if not provided; gpt-5 (non-chat) models without reasoning effort='none' require temperature=1 or unset (temperature is removed if other value provided); gpt-5-chat models allow any temperature.",
